<% confirm_url = confirmation_url(
     @resource,
     confirmation_token: @token,
     config:             message["client-config"].to_s,
     redirect_url:       message["redirect-url"]
   ) %>
Welcome <%= @email %>,

Confirming your email address shows buyers and sellers that this account is
real. You can keep using Hatiwal either way — but a verified account is a
trusted one.

Confirm your email by opening this link:
<%= confirm_url %>

If you didn't create a Hatiwal account, you can safely ignore this email.

— The Hatiwal Team
